('nr-1891981232-20823a7b8c26','naver-1891981232','naver','We had a lunch special course B. In general, good atmosphere and good staff. But sushi rice was not so good. It didn''t have the taste, a bit cold, and a bit hard to chew.','2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z'),
